  data: {
    LLM: "Stay Blind as long as possible. Betting half-price allows you to build the pot while making it expensive for Seeing players to stay in with marginal hands.\n\nThe 'Prial' Hunt: If you hold a pair of 3s, you are statistically likely to have the best hand. If you hold a 3 and a wild card ('Bragger'), your hand is incredibly strong.\n\nRange Inference: Watch the Betting Speed. A player who sees their cards and immediately raises is often representing a Run or better. A player who stays Blind for many rounds is either bluffing or has complete confidence in the shuffle.",
    Player: "Stay Blind as long as possible. Betting half-price allows you to build the pot while making it expensive for Seeing players to stay in with marginal hands.\n\nThe 'Prial' Hunt: If you hold a pair of 3s, you are statistically likely to have the best hand. If you hold a 3 and a wild card ('Bragger'), your hand is incredibly strong.\n\nRange Inference: Watch the Betting Speed. A player who sees their cards and immediately raises is often representing a Run or better. A player who stays Blind for many rounds is either bluffing or has complete confidence in the shuffle.",
